  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GUATEMALA Maternal and Infant Health and Nutrition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Project aims to support the Government of Guatemala to: (a) improve maternal and infant health in the project&apos;s 40 areas of intervention; and (b) reduce chronic malnutrition among children younger than 2 years of age in the rural areas of the 70 municipalities targeted by the project.</narrative>
  </description>
